# UI Stack

- Tailwind + shadcn/ui for primitives; Lucide for icons; Sonner for toasts; Motion for subtle motion.
- Respect `prefers-reduced-motion`. Animations must be fast and purposeful.
- Premium educational SaaS feel: clean hierarchy, consistent spacing, no emoji UI, no nested card clutter.
- Self-host fonts; do not rely on Google Fonts / Font Awesome CDN for essential UI.
- Recharts via shadcn chart patterns; charts must show real IndexedDB data or empty states.
